"""
Academic Writer — Frequent Content Terms

Extracts the researcher's high-frequency content vocabulary (a lemma-ish
approximation via simple normalization, not true lemmatization) excluding
common Hebrew and English stopwords. Consumed by the `write` skill's
frequentTerms field (used to steer vocabulary choices toward the researcher's
actual usage instead of generic academic filler).
"""

